"- Inner Bottle Wall\n    - Attribute 1 Type - smooth, curved inner surface of a bottle neck\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown to black with subtle amber reflections along the rim\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with inner diameter approximately 2.5 cm, outer diameter approximately 5.5 cm\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight surface texture and minor imperfections\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one continuous inner wall\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - forms the inner boundary of the bottle neck opening, surrounding the central aperture\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - concentrically aligned with the central aperture, facing inward toward the center\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - seamlessly connected to the glass rim and encloses the central aperture\n\n- Glass Rim\n    - Attribute 1 Type - thick, rounded, slightly beveled edge of the bottle neck\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown with amber-orange highlights from reflected light\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with an outer diameter approximately 5.5 cm and thickness approximately 0.5 cm\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - smooth glass with slight gloss and minor surface variations\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one continuous rim\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - forms the outermost boundary of the bottle neck, encircling the inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - horizontal, concentric with the central aperture, facing outward from the bottle’s interior\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - fused with the inner bottle wall and surrounding the central aperture\n\n- Bottle Neck Opening\n    - Attribute 1 Type - circular opening at the top of the bottle neck\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown to black with amber highlights along the rim\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with diameter approximately 2.5 cm\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight surface texture and minor imperfections\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one opening\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - located at the topmost point of the bottle neck, enclosed by the glass rim and inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - concentric with the central aperture, facing upward\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - directly connected to the inner bottle wall and glass rim, forming the boundary of the central aperture\n\n- Central Aperture\n    - Attribute 1 Type - circular void at the center of the bottle neck opening\n    - Attribute 2 Color - deep black with subtle reflective highlights\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with diameter approximately 2.5 cm\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass (implied by surrounding structure)\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - empty space bounded by the inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one aperture\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - centered within the bottle neck opening, surrounded by the inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - concentric with the bottle neck opening, facing upward\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - enclosed by the inner bottle wall, forming the innermost boundary of the bottle neck opening"